      "title": "Princess: East and the Expedition will be updated in part",
      "date": "2024-07-19 21:54:11",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5969041959970364007",
      "content": "  First of all, thank you for your support and comments on Princess: East and Expedition games. During this period, we will continue to optimize according to player feedback and game problems, and strive to do the best. We'll keep trying. Please give us some time.\nSecond, we will disclose some of the next version of the update:\n1. There will be an increase in the circadian system and related events\n2. Strengthen casual play such as planting, fishing, planting flowers, and cute pets, and give everyone a variety of props to obtain choices\n3. The main mission of Yanshen has opened two new imperial cities and related missions\n4. Add more CG to enrich CG quality\n5. More female characters will be introduced along with stories\n6. Add indoor scenes to enrich exploration\n\nDuring this period, we will continue to optimize the BUG problem and give you a better game experience, thank you!!",
